    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d944">

                <pb facs="0883" n="873" sameAs="frus:frus1941v05/pg873"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.1163/1041: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Grew</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-02-13T19:00:00-05:00">February 13,
                            1941—7 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>106. Peiping’s no. 529, December 29 [<hi rendition="#italic">21</hi>], 1 p.m. and
                    despatch 2995, December 30, 1940,<anchor n="23" xml:id="d944-f1"/> in regard to
                    the withdrawal of American missionaries from Shansi Province because of the
                    persecution of Chinese adherents.</p>
                <p>It is assumed that you are keeping this matter in mind with a view to taking an
                    appropriate occasion, in your discretion, of bringing it to the attention of the
                    Japanese Foreign Minister<anchor n="24" xml:id="d944-f2"/> as another example of
                    apparently deliberate action on the part of the Japanese military in China to
                    interfere with American citizens and their normal legitimate activities, and
                    that you will in due course report to the Department such conversation as you
                    may have with the Foreign Minister on this subject.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d944-f1" n="23" xml:id="d944-f1-content">
